<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21660" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭmĭtātor</span></b> ,
			ōris, m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an imitator</i>, <i>copyist</i>, <i>mimic</i> (class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">permulti imitatores principum exsistunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Leg. 3, 14, 31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Thucydidis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 1, 74</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Atticorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					ib. 115</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">12, 10, 14: veterum facinorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Vatin. 9, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brutus erat stulti sapiens imitator,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					2, 717</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fulminis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					M. 14, 618</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">natura fingit homines et creat imitatores et
					narratores facetos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. de Or. 2, 54, 219</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nec desilies imitator in artum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 134</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">o imitatores, servum pecus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Ep. 1, 19, 19</span></i>
			.</div>
